# Razorpay Payment Gateway Configuration
# 1. Sign up for a free account at https://razorpay.com
# 2. Go to Dashboard -> Settings -> API Keys (https://dashboard.razorpay.com/app/keys)
# 3. Generate a Test Key ID (e.g. rzp_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx)
# 4. Copy it below as VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID

VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_your_key_here
